-- The converter that made the plain text lost the column marks of the table: a row whose cells number the table's columns
-- (four for the court-fee tables of Parts 1, 3 and 4; the columns each Table of Part 2 or Part 5 names) is read column by
-- column in the order the text states them; any other row keeps its cells in the order stated and answers NOTHING when asked for a column.
-- It is not the official text, and nothing here has been checked against the official text.

